# Web Exploitation Cheatsheet

---

## Recon Order (always do this first)

```bash
# 1. Full page source — look for comments, hidden forms, JS includes
Ctrl+U (browser) or curl -s http://IP | less

# 2. Robots.txt and sitemap
curl http://IP/robots.txt
curl http://IP/sitemap.xml

# 3. Tech fingerprint
whatweb http://IP
curl -I http://IP     # response headers — server, X-Powered-By, cookies

# 4. Directory brute force
gobuster dir -u http://IP -w /usr/share/wordlists/dirb/common.txt -x php,html,txt,bak
ffuf -u http://IP/FUZZ -w /usr/share/seclists/Discovery/Web-Content/raft-medium-directories.txt

# 5. Subdomain enum (if domain-based)
ffuf -u http://IP -H "Host: FUZZ.domain.com" -w /usr/share/seclists/Discovery/DNS/subdomains-top1million-5000.txt -fs <default_size>
```

