## IDOR (Insecure Direct Object Reference)

```
# Change IDs in URLs
/profile?id=1  →  /profile?id=2

# Change IDs in POST bodies (use Burp Repeater)
{"user_id": 1}  →  {"user_id": 2}

# Check for GUIDs — sometimes predictable or leakable
# Try encoded values: base64, hex decode the ID first
```

